==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*15 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] at lv.20 can beat this stage rather easily.

==Trivia==
*Hotaruika Domain is named after the Japanese word 蛍烏賊 ''hotaruika'' ([[wikipedia:Firefly squid|firefly squid]]).

